# Commit checklist: PRs + security

Before every commit (and when the user asks to commit / push / создать PR), check and handle:

1. **Open PRs** — `gh pr list --repo Marfa/vikunja --state open`
2. **Malware** — https://github.com/Marfa/vikunja/security/malware
3. **Dependabot** — https://github.com/Marfa/vikunja/security/dependabot (`gh api repos/Marfa/vikunja/dependabot/alerts --jq '.[] | select(.state=="open")'`)

## How to handle

| Finding | Action |
|---------|--------|
| Dependabot PR, CI green, mergeable | Merge (`gh pr merge --merge`) |
| Dependabot PR, CI red / conflicts | Fix on the PR branch or recreate the bump; do not leave it idle |
| Open Dependabot alert with patched version | Bump package (direct dep) or lockfile / pnpm override (transitive); open/merge a fix PR |
| Alert with no patched version | Document in the commit/PR body; dismiss only with a real reason (`tolerable_risk` / `inaccurate` / `fix_started`) |
| Malware alert | Remove/replace the package immediately; never dismiss without remediation |
| Non-Dependabot open PR | Review status; merge if ready, or report blockers to the user |

Do this for `Marfa/vikunja` only. Report what was merged, fixed, or still open after the check.
